[SIZE=5][B]Installation (short)[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST=1]
[*]Amlogic USB Burning Tool 2.2.0 (run as administrator) → File → Import image → the unpacked .img → [B]Start[/B]. Keep "Erase flash" ticked and "Erase bootloader" unticked.
[*]Connect a USB-A ↔ USB-A cable to the box's [B]USB 2.0 (OTG) port[/B] (next to the SD slot) while the box is running, then from a running Android: [ICODE]adb connect <box-ip>:5555[/ICODE] and [ICODE]adb reboot update[/ICODE]. The tool flashes for 5–8 minutes.
[*]Unplug the cable, power-cycle the box, finish the setup with the remote.
[/LIST]
Full instructions, recovery paths and the serial-console fallback: [URL='https://github.com/MKmajster/gt-king-android-tv/blob/main/docs/release/INSTALL.md']INSTALL.md[/URL].

