[SIZE=5][B]Support[/B][/SIZE]
A hobby project, free and open. If it brought your GT-King back from the drawer, you can buy me a coffee — entirely optional: [URL='https://ko-fi.com/mkmajster']Ko-fi[/URL] (card or PayPal). Test reports help just as much: Ethernet, 4K/HDR TVs and HDMI-CEC are still untested.
Another Android TV box, or a project that needs a similar bring-up? I am open to taking on a new project or helping with an existing one — send me a PM or open an issue on GitHub.
The repository README is also available in [URL='https://github.com/MKmajster/gt-king-android-tv/blob/main/README.pl.md']Polish[/URL] and [URL='https://github.com/MKmajster/gt-king-android-tv/blob/main/README.zh-CN.md']Simplified Chinese[/URL].

